      "title": "The priority checklist — stop at the first that applies",
      "lines": [
        "1. An emergency vehicle with lights AND siren? — everyone yields to it",
        "2. A traffic light or a police officer directing? — obey it, it overrides signs",
        "3. A priority sign or shark's teeth? — the sign or paint decides",
        "4. A tram? — give way to it",
        "5. None of the above? — right before left"
